<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 669 MLN NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 669 MLN NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid to place 264 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills and for 405 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills against a joint 500 million zloty offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction should be available shortly.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
